into containers, including

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:29.450
how to assess your application,
create the migration plan,

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:31.750
execute the migration
plan, and deploy your newly

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.378
containerised application.

